message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "HEID: cell types and tissue structures from H&E across cancers"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xiong
    given-names: Jiajie
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ding-lab/HEID"
abstract: >-
  H&E cell classification and image alignment, molecular definition of tumor boundaries,
  TLS and Schwann/Glial regions, and separate H&E tumor-boundary prediction, TLS region and
  maturation prediction, and nerve-region geometry on image-derived cell probabilities.
